      "body": "去年做了个[b站年度总结](https://github.com/ruanyf/weekly/issues/6366)，很荣幸上了周刊，现在该到微信的年度总结了\n\n### 项目介绍：[WeChatDataAnalysis](https://github.com/LifeArchiveProject/WeChatDataAnalysis) 是一个可以对微信4.x数据解密并生成年度总结，界面高仿微信，支持实时更新，导出聊天记录，朋友圈等大量便捷功能的项目\n\n---\n\n## 年度总结\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" colspan=\"2\"><img src=\"https://github.com/LifeArchiveProject/WeChatDataAnalysis/raw/main/frontend/public/style1.png\" alt=\"年度总结 Modern\" width=\"800\"/></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"https://github.com/LifeArchiveProject/WeChatDataAnalysis/raw/main/frontend/public/AnnualSummary1.png\" alt=\"AnnualSummary 1\" width=\"400\"/></td>\n    <td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LifeArchiveProject/WeChatDataAnalysis/main/frontend/public/AnnualSummary2.png\" alt=\"AnnualSummary 2\" width=\"400\"/></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/LifeArchiveProject/WeChatDataAnalysis/main/frontend/public/AnnualSummary3.png\" alt=\"AnnualSummary 3\" width=\"400\"/></td>\n    <td><img src=\"https://github.com/LifeArchiveProject/WeChatDataAnalysis/raw/main/frontend/public/AnnualSummary4.gif\" alt=\"AnnualSummary 4\" width=\"400\"/></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"https://github.com/LifeArchiveProject/WeChatDataAnalysis/raw/main/frontend/public/AnnualSummary5.gif\" alt=\"AnnualSummary 5\" width=\"400\"/></td>\n    <td><img src=\"https://github.com/LifeArchiveProject/WeChatDataAnalysis/raw/main/frontend/public/AnnualSummary6.png\" alt=\"AnnualSummary 6\" width=\"400\"/></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><img src=\"https://github.com/LifeArchiveProject/WeChatDataAnalysis/raw/main/frontend/public/AnnualSummary7.png\" alt=\"AnnualSummary 7\" width=\"400\"/></td>\n    <td><img src=\"https://github.com/LifeArchiveProject/WeChatDataAnalysis/raw/main/frontend/public/AnnualSummary8.png\" alt=\"AnnualSummary 8\" width=\"400\"/></td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n---\n\n## 部分界面预览\n\n<table>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" colspan=\"2\"><b>聊天记录页面</b>（支持多种消息类型展示，样式尽可能与微信保持一致）</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/LifeArchiveProject/WeChatDataAnalysis/raw/main/frontend/public/message.png\" alt=\"聊天记录页面\" width=\"800\"/></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" colspan=\"2\"><b>修改消息</b>（本地修改，支持恢复）</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/LifeArchiveProject/WeChatDataAnalysis/raw/main/frontend/public/edit.gif\" alt=\"修改消息\" width=\"800\"/></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" colspan=\"2\"><b>实时消息同步</b>（点击侧边栏闪电图标后，消息会自动刷新）</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/LifeArchiveProject/WeChatDataAnalysis/raw/main/frontend/public/RealTimeMessages.gif\" alt=\"实时消息同步\" width=\"800\"/></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" colspan=\"2\"><b>朋友圈</b>（支持查看用户之前朋友圈的背景图及时间；本地查看过的朋友圈即使后续不可见也可以查看）</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/LifeArchiveProject/WeChatDataAnalysis/raw/main/frontend/public/sns.png\" alt=\"朋友圈\" width=\"800\"/></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td align=\"center\" colspan=\"2\"><b>聊天记录导出</b></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td colspan=\"2\" align=\"center\"><img src=\"https://github.com/LifeArchiveProject/WeChatDataAnalysis/raw/main/frontend/public/export.png\" alt=\"聊天记录导出\" width=\"800\"/></td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n",
